---
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../../consts';
import DoubleBox from '../../components/DoubleBox.astro';
import BoxBanner from '../../components/BoxBanner.astro';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Aviso de Privacidad" description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}>
        <div class=" my-12 mx-auto max-w-[1080px]">
            <h1
                class="audiowide neon-verde text-center md:text-left pt-4 font-bold text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-4xl xl:text-5xl"
            >
                Código de Ética y Lineamientos Generales para la Protección de los Derechos de las Audiencias
            </h1>
            <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row">
                <div class="sm:min-w-[calc(100%-400px)] lg:mr-10 roboto">
                <br>
<p>En cumplimiento de la legislación vigente, ponemos a disposición de nuestros radioescuchas los datos de contacto de los Defensores de las Audiencias designados por la Cámara Nacional de la Industria de Radio y Televisión (CIRT), quienes reciben y atienden quejas, observaciones y sugerencias relacionadas con nuestros contenidos y programación.</p>
<p>Lic. Eli Manuel Ramírez Villaseñor</p>
<div class="contact-email">
    <a class="contact-address" href="mailto:defensor1@cirtcomunicacion.com">defensor1@cirtcomunicacion.com</a>
    <div class="mail-actions" aria-label="Escribir a defensor1@cirtcomunicacion.com">
        <a
            class="mail-action gmail"
            href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&to=defensor1%40cirtcomunicacion.com&su=Contacto%20con%20la%20Defensor%C3%ADa%20de%20las%20Audiencias"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
            <span>Gmail</span>
        </a>
        <a
            class="mail-action outlook"
            href="https://outlook.office.com/mail/deeplink/compose?to=defensor1%40cirtcomunicacion.com&subject=Contacto%20con%20la%20Defensor%C3%ADa%20de%20las%20Audiencias"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
            <span>Outlook</span>
        </a>
    </div>
</div>
<p>Lic. Fabiana Estrada Tena</p>
<div class="contact-email">
    <a class="contact-address" href="mailto:defensor2@cirtcomunicacion.com">defensor2@cirtcomunicacion.com</a>
    <div class="mail-actions" aria-label="Escribir a defensor2@cirtcomunicacion.com">
        <a
            class="mail-action gmail"
            href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&to=defensor2%40cirtcomunicacion.com&su=Contacto%20con%20la%20Defensor%C3%ADa%20de%20las%20Audiencias"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
            <span>Gmail</span>
        </a>
        <a
            class="mail-action outlook"
            href="https://outlook.office.com/mail/deeplink/compose?to=defensor2%40cirtcomunicacion.com&subject=Contacto%20con%20la%20Defensor%C3%ADa%20de%20las%20Audiencias"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
            <span>Outlook</span>
        </a>
    </div>
</div>
<p>Domicilio: Av. Horacio 1013, Col. Polanco III Sección, Alcaldía Miguel Hidalgo, C.P. 11540, Ciudad de México.</p>
<p>Teléfono: 55 5726 9909</p>
<div class="download-list" aria-label="Documentos para descargar">
    <a
        class="download-card"
        href="https://storage.googleapis.com/nrm-web/nrm/CodigoEtica/CODIGO%20DE%20ETICA%202026%20AFILIADOS%20CIRT%20-%20C%20IA.%20MEX.%20DE%20RADIODIFUSION%20(XEPH-AM)%20(SABR).pdf"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        aria-label="Descargar Código de Ética en PDF"
    >
        <span class="document-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                <path d="M7 3.75h7l4.25 4.3v12.2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-12.5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2Z" />
                <path d="M14 3.75v4.5h4.25M8.5 12h7M8.5 15.5h7" />
            </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="document-copy">
            <span class="document-title">Código de Ética</span>
            <span class="document-caption">Descargar PDF</span>
        </span>
        <span class="download-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                <path d="M12 3.75v11m0 0 4-4m-4 4-4-4M5 15.75v3.5h14v-3.5" />
            </svg>
        </span>
    </a>
    <a
        class="download-card"
        href="https://storage.googleapis.com/nrm-web/nrm/CodigoEtica/Lineamientos%20Generales%20para%20la%20Proteccio%CC%81n%20de%20los%20Derechos%20de%20las%20Audiencias.pdf"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        aria-label="Descargar Lineamientos Generales para la Protección de los Derechos de las Audiencias en PDF"
    >
        <span class="document-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                <path d="M7 3.75h7l4.25 4.3v12.2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-12.5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2Z" />
                <path d="M14 3.75v4.5h4.25M8.5 12h7M8.5 15.5h7" />
            </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="document-copy">
            <span class="document-title">Lineamientos Generales para la Protección de los Derechos de las Audiencias</span>
            <span class="document-caption">Descargar PDF</span>
        </span>
        <span class="download-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                <path d="M12 3.75v11m0 0 4-4m-4 4-4-4M5 15.75v3.5h14v-3.5" />
            </svg>
        </span>
    </a>
</div>
                </div>



            </div>
        </div>
</Layout>


<style>
a {
    color: #60A5FA;
}

.contact-email {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.contact-address {
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.mail-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
}

.mail-action {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    min-height: 3rem;
    padding: 0.65rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid #60A5FA;
    border-radius: 0.375rem;
    background: #fff;
    color: #1e293b;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 150ms ease, border-color 150ms ease;
}

.mail-action:hover {
    border-color: #3b82f6;
    background: #eff6ff;
}

.mail-action:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #2563eb;
    outline-offset: 2px;
}

.download-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
}

.download-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3rem minmax(0, 1fr) 2.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    min-height: 5.25rem;
    padding: 0.875rem 1.125rem;
    border: 1px solid #d7dbe0;
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    background: #fff;
    color: #171717;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 150ms ease, background-color 150ms ease;
}

.download-card:hover {
    border-color: #3b82f6;
    background: #eff6ff;
}

.download-card:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #2563eb;
    outline-offset: 3px;
}

.document-icon {
    display: grid;
    width: 3rem;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    background: #60A5FA;
    color: #fff;
}

.document-icon svg {
    width: 1.5rem;
    height: 1.5rem;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
    stroke-width: 1.7;
}

.document-copy {
    display: grid;
    min-width: 0;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
}

.document-title {
    color: #171717;
    font-family: 'League Spartan', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.document-caption {
    color: #60A5FA;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
}

.download-icon {
    display: grid;
    width: 2.5rem;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    place-items: center;
    border: 1px solid #cbd0d6;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: #171717;
    transition: border-color 150ms ease, color 150ms ease, transform 150ms ease;
}

.download-icon svg {
    width: 1.125rem;
    height: 1.125rem;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
    stroke-width: 1.7;
}

.download-card:hover .download-icon {
    border-color: #3b82f6;
    color: #2563eb;
    transform: translateY(2px);
}

@media (max-width: 480px) {
    .download-card {
        grid-template-columns: 2.75rem minmax(0, 1fr) 2.25rem;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        padding-inline: 0.75rem;
    }

    .document-icon {
        width: 2.75rem;
    }

    .download-icon {
        width: 2.25rem;
    }
}

</style>